{
 "label": "Measured Orin 4B device latency for DASHCAM (EP-G) and SINGLE-SHOT, for the live device wait (D168 / D169 follow-up)",
 "_mode_and_whether_it_matches_deployment": {
  "dashcam": "StudySH-EP condition EP-G on nesl-orin-3, Jetson vLLM DEPLOYMENT DEFAULT config per sh_ep_orin_launch.json (--max-num-seqs 1 serial, --enable-prefix-caching, --dtype bfloat16, --max-model-len 32768, --gpu-memory-utilization 0.4, --enforce-eager, vLLM 0.20.0). Two modes are separated rather than pooled: WARM APPEND (n_new_images == 1, one new frame onto the warm episode context) is the deployment mode under D148 and D153; EPISODE START / full re-send (all frames new) is the other. Matches deployment for the append path.",
  "single_shot": "StudySS2 device runs on jetson_orin (realworldqa_device.json, refspatial_device.json), qwen3vl4b at the Orin endpoint. Each request is a distinct image and task so there is no warm reuse, which IS the single-shot mode by nature (one view, one answer, no history). Matches deployment."
 },
